Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Desk update · 5 October.** Ticket #4471 is closed. Engineering fixed the shared parser with
`fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`. The booking-v3 hint issue won't be fixed because the
booking-v3 form was retired.

<Callout>
Resolved: parser fixed. Hint issue won't be fixed; booking-v3 is retired.
</Callout>

